            <div xml:id="d635">

                <pb facs="0678" n="570" sameAs="frus:frus1927v02/pg570"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">883.6363/15: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Egypt</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Alexandria</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1926-07-20T10:00:00+02:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 20,
                                1926—10 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received July 20—9:17
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>28. Your telegram No. 17, July 19, 5 p.m. Had conferred with representative of
                    company several times. Shall press further for a reply from Government to
                    written and oral representations made by Legation June 8th, 29th, July 10th.
                    Report by mail.<anchor n="20" xml:id="d635-f1"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Johnson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
